---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="PurrSafe terms">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-block: 4rem">
    <a href="/">← Back to PurrSafe</a>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>PurrSafe is a private beta record-keeping tool for cat care notes. It does not provide veterinary advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>
    <p>Beta access may change or end while the service is being tested. Do not use PurrSafe for emergencies; contact a veterinarian when you are worried about your cat.</p>
    <p>Final terms and operator contact details will be published before public launch.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
